{
  "format": "rsl-strategy@1",
  "name": "intraday_opening_range",
  "note": [
    "OPENING RANGE BREAKOUT - la famille intraday la plus ancienne.",
    "",
    "L'etendue des trente premieres minutes sert de bande ; on suit la",
    "cassure, et on sort au retour sous le VWAP ancre ou a la cloture.",
    "",
    "Ce que cet exemple montre du vocabulaire : `cumulative.mask`, qui",
    "agrege sur une TRANCHE de seance sans sentinelle.",
    "",
    "Ce qu'il ne pretend pas etre : une strategie qu'on a validee. Aucun",
    "essai n'est archive pour elle, et ses seuils - 30 minutes, la borne",
    "a 330 - sont les valeurs usuelles de la litterature, pas un choix",
    "mesure. Elle sert de FORME, pas de resultat."
  ],
  "definitions": {
    "vwap_ancre": {
      "type": "arith",
      "op": "/",
      "left": {
        "type": "cumulative",
        "stat": "sum",
        "inner": {
          "type": "arith",
          "op": "*",
          "left": {
            "type": "arith",
            "op": "/",
            "left": {
              "type": "arith",
              "op": "+",
              "left": {
                "type": "arith",
                "op": "+",
                "left": {
                  "type": "price",
                  "field": "high",
                  "lag": 0
                },
                "right": {
                  "type": "price",
                  "field": "low",
                  "lag": 0
                }
              },
              "right": {
                "type": "price",
                "field": "close",
                "lag": 0
              }
            },
            "right": {
              "type": "constant",
              "value": 3.0
            }
          },
          "right": {
            "type": "price",
            "field": "volume",
            "lag": 0
          }
        }
      },
      "right": {
        "type": "cumulative",
        "stat": "sum",
        "inner": {
          "type": "price",
          "field": "volume",
          "lag": 0
        }
      },
      "note": "VWAP ANCRE sur la seance declaree, sur le prix typique."
    }
  },
  "strategy": {
    "ref": "rules@1",
    "params": {
      "quantity": 1,
      "allow_pyramiding": false,
      "rules": {
        "entry_long": {
          "type": "all_of",
          "operands": [
            {
              "type": "compare",
              "op": ">",
              "left": {
                "type": "session",
                "field": "minutes_from_open",
                "lag": 0
              },
              "right": {
                "type": "constant",
                "value": 30.0
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "compare",
              "op": "<",
              "left": {
                "type": "session",
                "field": "minutes_from_open",
                "lag": 0
              },
              "right": {
                "type": "constant",
                "value": 330.0
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "compare",
              "op": ">",
              "left": {
                "type": "price",
                "field": "close",
                "lag": 0
              },
              "right": {
                "type": "cumulative",
                "stat": "max",
                "inner": {
                  "type": "price",
                  "field": "high",
                  "lag": 0
                },
                "mask": {
                  "type": "compare",
                  "op": "<=",
                  "left": {
                    "type": "session",
                    "field": "minutes_from_open",
                    "lag": 0
                  },
                  "right": {
                    "type": "constant",
                    "value": 30.0
                  }
                },
                "note": [
                  "Extremum des 30 premieres minutes de la seance.",
                  "Le `mask` n'agrege que les barres ou il est vrai, et rend `None` si",
                  "aucune ne l'est - la ou l'ecriture par sentinelle rendait -1e18 et",
                  "faisait declencher la regle partout (lecon L30)."
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "exit_long": {
          "type": "any_of",
          "operands": [
            {
              "type": "compare",
              "op": "<",
              "left": {
                "type": "price",
                "field": "close",
                "lag": 0
              },
              "right": {
                "$ref": "vwap_ancre"
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "compare",
              "op": "==",
              "left": {
                "type": "session",
                "field": "is_last",
                "lag": 0
              },
              "right": {
                "type": "constant",
                "value": 1.0
              }
            }
          ],
          "note": [
            "Cloture forcee : aucune position ne franchit la nuit. C'est ce qui",
            "fait d'une strategie une strategie INTRADAY, et non un swing trade",
            "qui se trouve decider souvent."
          ]
        },
